    "geometryEdits": "Regenerated from the original source records, clipped to the declared bbox with the west edge extended to -25 degrees to retain Iceland; only the existing sourceRecords are included; make_valid where required; topology-preserving Douglas–Peucker simplification at 0.007 degrees; valid-output coordinate grid 0.00001 degrees; standard GeoJSON orientation. Overview semantic properties, identifiers and coalesced intervals retained. Where finer geometry differs inside an overview interval, geometryVariants preserves the original source intervals. No geometry invented or interpolated.",
