    "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
    "citation": "Bennett, J. S., Mutch, E., Tollefson, A., et al. (2025). Cliopatria – A geospatial database of world-wide political entities from 3400BCE to 2024CE. Scientific Data 12, 247.",
